note rope: one rotated pair. theta = pos * ts^i (f32, multiplied i times as ggml_rope_cache_init),
note times freq_scale; out0 = x0*c - x1*s, out1 = x0*s + x1*c with c, s = cos, sin(theta)*attn_factor.
note xy packs x0 (low 32 bits) and x1; fa packs freq_scale (low) and attn_factor. Returns the packed pair.
fn lo32 v ulong to f32
ret bitcast f32 uint and v 4294967295
end
fn hi32 v ulong to f32
ret bitcast f32 uint shr v 32
end
fn rth pos ulong i ulong ts ulong fs f32 to f64
t = f32 bitcast int uint pos
tsf = bitcast f32 uint ts
for k ulong i
t = mul t tsf
end
ret f64 mul fs t
end
fn pack a f32 b f32 to ulong
ret or ulong bitcast uint a shl ulong bitcast uint b 32
end
fn rope xy ulong pos ulong i ulong ts ulong fa ulong to ulong
th = rth pos i ts lo32 fa
af = hi32 fa
c = mul f32 sc64 th 1 af
s = mul f32 sc64 th 0 af
x0 = lo32 xy
x1 = hi32 xy
o0 = sub mul x0 c mul x1 s
o1 = add mul x0 s mul x1 c
ret pack o0 o1
end
